<title>KAZAKHSTAN: SOCCER-KAZAKHSTAN BEAT PAKISTAN IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-KAZAKHSTAN BEAT PAKISTAN IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-05-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kazakhstan beat Pakistan 3-0</p>
<p>(halftime 1-0) in a World Cup soccer Asian zone group nine</p>
<p>qualifier on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Bolat Yesmagambetov 3, 62 Valery Yablochkin 50</p>
<p>Attendance: 12,000</p>
</text>
